description: Test rules for anomaly-detection behavior.
globs: backend/tests/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

# Anomaly tests

- Use synthetic arrays and temporary folders. Do not commit MVTec images.
- Seed any random split or noise and assert which ids landed in validation.
- A threshold fixture must be computed from validation scores only.
- Assert shapes, dtypes, and error codes. Avoid exact float equality on distances unless the case is discrete.
- Catalog tests must fail if a category or model id disappears from YAML.
- Keep image fixtures tiny.
